"The VPN dial counted connections that had started themselves automatically, sitting right above the list of rules it looked like it was counting. Login Items & Extensions’ bottom bar mixed how many items were found with the size of what you’d selected." = "The VPN dial counted connections that had started themselves automatically, sitting right above the list of rules it looked like it was counting. Login Items & Extensions’ bottom bar mixed how many items were found with the size of what you’d selected.";
