"The panel is arranged in the panel. “Edit panel” in its footer: give a widget one of three sizes, take one off, add one from the gallery, make a tab. Keep Awake, VPN, Autopilot, Disk and Keyboard come in more than one size, and Disk shows how much of the disk is still free." = "The panel is arranged in the panel. “Edit panel” in its footer: give a widget one of three sizes, take one off, add one from the gallery, make a tab. Keep Awake, VPN, Autopilot, Disk and Keyboard come in more than one size, and Disk shows how much of the disk is still free.";
