"The battery guard says so on screen, names the setting that stopped it and how to lift it, and now reaches you with a notification even when you are not looking at Helm. It used to end sessions in silence — you pressed “15 min” at 5% and nothing happened, with the reason only in the log." = "The battery guard says so on screen, names the setting that stopped it and how to lift it, and now reaches you with a notification even when you are not looking at Helm. It used to end sessions in silence — you pressed “15 min” at 5% and nothing happened, with the reason only in the log.";
